Package: tccquickr
Title: Typed Experimental R Transformation Core
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      given = "Sounkou Mahamane",
      family = "Toure",
      email = "sounkoutoure@gmail.com",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: A hard-reset experimental compiler core for a declared subset of R.
    The package now starts from typed schemas, classed diagnostics, explicit
    compiler contracts, shape-aware intermediate representations, and generic
    backend planning. Initial source printers consume a backend-neutral lowered
    program rather than owning compiler semantics.
